<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8240] .NET: Use default scheduler when starting Tasks</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8240</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Default scheduler should be specified explicitly when starting new tasks to avoid deadlocks: &lt;a href=&quot;http://blog.stephencleary.com/2013/10/continuewith-is-dangerous-too.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://blog.stephencleary.com/2013/10/continuewith-is-dangerous-too.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This applies to &lt;tt&gt;StartNew&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;ConyinueWith&lt;/tt&gt;, etc.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
